{"success":true,"data":{"id":5,"name_en":"Zhoug — Green Chilli Dip","name_cn":"麻辣青辣椒酱（Zhoug）","sku":"1-225","category":"Fresh & Deli","top_category":"Fresh & Deli","subcategory":"Spreads & Dips","size":"150g","barcode":null,"price":42,"compare_at_price":null,"stock":96,"display_order":null,"description_en":"<!-- x-tinymce/html --><p><strong>Green Chili Dip (Zhoug) 🌶️</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Product type: Ready-to-eat refrigerated dip ❄️</p>\n<p>Net weight: 150g ⚖️</p>\n<p>Origin: Guangzhou, China 🌍</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>PRODUCT DESCRIPTION 🧾</strong></p>\n<p>This is our take on a green chili dip.</p>\n<p>Fresh cilantro, green chili, garlic, and spices blended into a bright, punchy sauce.</p>\n<p>Herb-forward, clean, and lightly spiced.</p>\n<p>Not aggressive — just enough heat to wake things up.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>WHY PEOPLE CHOOSE IT 🌿</strong></p>\n<p>Fresh herb flavor with controlled heat.</p>\n<p>Light, sharp, and easy to pair.</p>\n<p>Adds contrast without overpowering the dish.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS 🌱</strong></p>\n<p>Fresh cilantro, green chili, garlic, olive oil, lemon juice, spices, salt</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>CONTAINS / MAY CONTAIN ⚠️</strong></p>\n<p>Contains: None declared<br>May contain traces of: Nuts, soy, gluten</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>HOW TO USE 🍽️</strong></p>\n<p>Use as a dip, spread, or finishing sauce.</p>\n<p>Pairs well with wraps, bowls, roasted vegetables, or grains.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>STORAGE ❄️</strong></p>\n<p>Keep refrigerated at 0–4°C.<br>Shelf life: See packaging.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>NUTRITION (Per serving 2 tbsp / 30g) 🧮</strong></p>\n<p>Energy 175kcal<br>Protein 0.8g<br>Total fat 18.0g<br>– Saturated fat 2.3g<br>– Unsaturated fat 15.7g<br>Carbohydrate 2.5g<br>– Sugars 0.6g<br>Dietary fiber 0.7g<br>Sodium 115mg</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>INTENDED USE / NOTES 📌</strong></p>\n<p>Plant-based herb chili dip 🌿<br>Mild heat level<br>Shake or stir before use if separation occurs</p>","description_cn":"<!-- x-tinymce/html --><p><strong>绿色辣椒酱（Zhoug）🌶️</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>产品类型：即食冷藏蘸酱 ❄️</p>\n<p>净含量：150g ⚖️</p>\n<p>产地：中国广州 🌍</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>产品描述 🧾</strong></p>\n<p>这是我们对绿色辣椒酱的理解。</p>\n<p>新鲜香菜、青辣椒、大蒜与香料打碎融合，形成一款明亮、有冲击力的酱料。</p>\n<p>香草感明显，干净利落，带一点点辣度。</p>\n<p>不过火，但足够提神。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>为什么人们会选它 🌿</strong></p>\n<p>新鲜香草风味，辣度控制得当。</p>\n<p>清爽、利落，易于搭配。</p>\n<p>增加风味对比，但不会抢味。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>配料表</strong></p>","description_format":"rich","free_of":null,"tags":"auto","ship_from_supplier":null,"image_data":null,"image_url":"/api/retail/products/5/image?v=1781757233","image_aspect":null,"nutrition":{"basis_en":"Per serving (2 tbsp / 30g)","basis_cn":"每份（2汤匙 / 30克）","rows":[{"label_en":"Energy","label_cn":"能量","value":"175 kcal"},{"label_en":"Protein","label_cn":"蛋白质","value":"0.8g"},{"label_en":"Total Fat","label_cn":"脂肪","value":"18.0g"},{"label_en":"— Saturated Fat","label_cn":"— 饱和脂肪","value":"2.3g"},{"label_en":"— Unsaturated Fat","label_cn":"— 不饱和脂肪","value":"15.7g"},{"label_en":"Carbohydrate","label_cn":"碳水化合物","value":"2.5g"},{"label_en":"— Sugars","label_cn":"— 糖","value":"0.6g"},{"label_en":"Dietary Fiber","label_cn":"膳食纤维","value":"0.7g"},{"label_en":"Sodium","label_cn":"钠","value":"115mg"}]},"keywords_en":null,"keywords_cn":null,"tagline_en":null,"tagline_cn":null,"description_blocks":[{"type":"spec_strip","cells":[{"k_en":"Product Type","k_cn":"产品类型","v_en":"Ready-to-eat refrigerated dip","v_cn":"即食冷藏蘸酱"},{"k_en":"Net Wt","k_cn":"净含量","v_en":"150g","v_cn":"150g"},{"k_en":"Origin","k_cn":"产地","v_en":"Guangzhou, China","v_cn":"中国广州"}],"id":"bmqaj8arw0"},{"type":"hero_intro","kicker_en":"Green Chili Dip · Zhoug","kicker_cn":"绿色辣椒酱 · Zhoug","body_en":"Herb-forward. Just enough heat. Fresh cilantro, green c